      <p class="eyebrow">4-week live bootcamp</p>
      <h2>GMAT Quant Bootcamp</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">A focused, structured program covering every Quant topic, built around timed practice and the no-calculator strategies that save minutes.</p>
      <div class="weeks">
        <div><strong>Week 1</strong> Number properties, arithmetic, mental math shortcuts</div>
        <div><strong>Week 2</strong> Algebra, inequalities, functions, exponents &amp; roots</div>
        <div><strong>Week 3</strong> Word problems: rates, work, mixtures, percents, ratios</div>
        <div><strong>Week 4</strong> Statistics, counting &amp; probability, full timed sections, pacing plan</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="price-card">
      <div class="price"><%= site.bootcampPrice %></div>
      <div class="muted">one-time · 4 weeks</div>
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li>8 live Zoom classes (2 per week)</li>
        <li>Weekly timed practice sets with worked solutions</li>
        <li>Class recordings in your student area</li>
        <li>Ask-the-tutor questions answered between classes</li>
        <li>Full-length Quant section review before test day</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-block" href="<%= user ? '/dashboard#bootcamp' : '/register' %>">Register for the bootcamp</a>
      <p class="small muted center">Not sure yet? <a href="<%= user ? '/dashboard#free-session' : '/register?next=free' %>">Start with the free session.</a></p>
